'''NEO Darkness Heaven''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] and appears every Wednesday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Bronze Cat (Rare Cat)|Bronze Cat]]: Quizmaster Cat.

